  "_comment": "Source of truth for folders and pages. Categories are the 10 Threshold Dashboard categories (internalapi /threshold-categories). Programs are the LT Info monitoring programs that carry a category (internalapi /monitoring-programs, captured Oct. 27, 2026), plus LTIMP (15), which is uncategorized in LT Info and placed in Water Quality here. Each program's optional measures list charts layers and tables from the TRPA LTInfo_Monitoring map service (https://maps.trpa.org/server/rest/services/LTInfo_Monitoring/MapServer); see templates/README.md for the keys. Each program's template (charts, map, or context) picks its page layout. Run scripts/scaffold_programs.py --force after editing measures.",
